<tr><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">最常中嘅陷阱（勾選）</div>
<div class="trap-list">
<div class="trap-item" style="background:#FFF;">☐ T4 除數中間補0漏寫</div>
<div class="trap-item" style="background:#FFF;">☐ T10 先乘除後加減忘記</div>
<div class="trap-item" style="background:#FFF;">☐ T19/T20 HCF/LCM方向調轉</div>
